{wait}

[msg MSG_004 speaker 0] // Hikawa
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}...A man's greed is like fire.
While it is small, it is warm
and comfortable.
{wait}

[msg MSG_005 speaker 0] // Hikawa
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}But, fire eventually grows
into flames, devouring everything
in its path.
{wait}

[msg MSG_005B speaker 0] // Hikawa
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}Mankind grew to covet fire.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}Humans became dependent on
its warmth, and averted their eyes
from its destructive nature.
{wait}

[msg MSG_006 speaker 0] // Hikawa
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}Humans should serve the world.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}By doing so, a life of repose
